These figures include only transactions with status {{v47}} within the defined window, excluding submitted items (such as {{v60}}) and transactions at or before the start boundary (such as {{v45}}).

**Why this is not a profit figure:**
The server explicitly defines the settled window as observed settled transactions only. As noted in the metric definitions, "Cashflow is not revenue, expense or profit." Additionally, the Profit & Loss (P&L) status is {{v15}} because a bank statement or transaction list does not constitute a full P&L report, which would require matching revenues with expenses and accounting for non-cash items.

For {{v9}}, the server-computed business health metrics (snapshot {{v2}}, as of {{v3}}) are:

- Net working position: {{v16}}
